# userscripts

My userscripts for Violentmonkey.

## scripts

If you have Violentmonkey installed, click on the name of the script to install it.

- [facebook-force-h264.user.js](https://github.com/Zorbiks/userscripts/raw/refs/heads/main/facebook-force-h264.user.js): Makes Facebook serve H.264 video instead of VP9/AV1/HEVC.
